  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（アイドルって仕事で今後も食べていくなら、\nこういう有名番組には出演しておきたいよねー）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "北村 想楽"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（芸能界の汚れを掃除する、いい機会だな)",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（海の魅力をテレビで紹介すれば、\n同志が増えるかもしれません……！）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "古論 クリス"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "オーディション突破の壁は高いでしょうが、\n我々の力を合わせて頑張りましょう！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "古論 クリス"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……クリスさんの言う通り、\nハードルは高そうだなー。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "北村 想楽"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ねえ、●●●●プロデューサーさん。今回の\nオーディション、どんなことをすればいいのかなー。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "北村 想楽"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "皆さん一人一人が持つ『自分らしさ』を\nアピールすることも大事ですが……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "結成したてのユニットですから、『ユニットの魅力』\nを知ってもらうことも大事ですね！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "番組の趣旨を考えると、\n雨彦の掃除スキルを伝えれば問題ないでしょう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "古論 クリス"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "はは、そういうことなら任せてくれ。\n実地で掃除を見せられれば一番いいんだがな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（……ユニットの魅力かー。\nプロデューサーさんも難しいこと言うなー）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "北村 想楽"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-25:text",
        "step_id": 25,
        "step_index": 24,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 24
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_text": "事務所",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-29:caption",
        "step_id": 29,
        "step_index": 28,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 28
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "●●●●プロデューサーさんですか？\n東雲です。今、少しだけお時間、大丈夫ですか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-34:text",
        "step_id": 34,
        "step_index": 33,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 33
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "実は、Legendersのみなさんが、お掃除解決隊の\nオーディションを受けると聞きまして……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-35:text",
        "step_id": 35,
        "step_index": 34,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 34
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "choice",
      "source_text": "もしかして応援を？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-36:option-0",
        "step_id": 36,
        "step_index": 35,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 35
        }
      },
      "option": {
        "choice_id": null,
        "option_id": null,
        "source_label": "phone_select1",
        "target_step_id": 37,
        "target_step_index": 36,
        "resolution": "resolved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "はい、そうです。……というのも、実は私、\nあのコーナーをよくチェックしているもので。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-37:text",
        "step_id": 37,
        "step_index": 36,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 36
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うちのカフェの清掃にも役立つ情報を\nよく放送してくれるんですよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-38:text",
        "step_id": 38,
        "step_index": 37,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 37
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "頑固な汚れを拭き取る技や、掃除を時短で\nすませる方法など、大変役立っています。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-39:text",
        "step_id": 39,
        "step_index": 38,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 38
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "今もまさに、新作のケーキ作りをしていたのですが。\n夢中で作業をしていたら、厨房が……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-40:text",
        "step_id": 40,
        "step_index": 39,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 39
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "どうやら、以前番組でやっていた\n新しい技を試すことになりそうです。ふふ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-41:text",
        "step_id": 41,
        "step_index": 40,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 40
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "では、私はそろそろ掃除にとりかかります。\nみなさんに、頑張ってくださいとお伝えください。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_d:step-42:text",
        "step_id": 42,
        "step_index": 41,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 41
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "合格したら絶対に番組を見ます、とも。\n……それでは、失礼しますね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
